</span></td>
<td id="S3.T2.5.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:2.0pt;padding-right:2.0pt;">
<span id="S3.T2.5.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:142.3pt;">
