<td id="S4.T5.6.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" colspan="2"><span id="S4.T5.6.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Tested on Torch 2.2</span></td></tr>
